            {
               "text": "<p><span id=\"htZoomImageMsg\"></span></p><p><h3>Prerequisites</h3>In this text, we explore the concept of equality. For a deeper understanding, we recommend reading the following first:</p><p><ul><li><b>Drawing to count</b>: See how we replaced our fingers with geometric shapes (<htcite0>).</li><li><b>Our current numbers</b>: Learn about the numbers we use today (<htcite1>).</li><li><b>Numerical families (Part I)</b>: Discover the possible relationship between our ancestors and numbers (<htcite2>).</li><li><b>Change of direction</b>: Explore the direction in which Indigenous peoples write their numbers (<htcite3>).</li><li><b>Numerical families (Part II)</b>: Learn the names of generations and numerical orders (<htcite4>).</li></ul></p>",
